; --- E1-03: In the late summer of Year 1, two days before the autumn equinox, the Council questioned Coraline Ash at the Watch. The questioning lasted for one afternoon. Old Vesh said that the village lacked an apprentice candidate from a Keeper family that year. The Council accepted Coraline Ash as an apprentice by a vote. The Council assigned the apprentice Coraline Ash to Pell. Pell was nineteen years old.
