; --- E2-02: On day 17 of Year 1, the Council held an emergency meeting in the afternoon. The Council decided to begin salt-bloom additions that afternoon. Hesper distributed pouches of salt-bloom to the keepers of the Cliff Path. The Council spoke to the keepers of the Northcove. The Northcove did not need salt-bloom. The Council recorded the cold snap in the ledger.
