; --- E2-03: On day 17 of Year 1, the keepers on the Cliff Path added salt-bloom to the mire-essence of their lanterns at sundown. The mire-essence in the lanterns burned slowly. The cold wind struck the Cliff Path again that night. No lantern on the Cliff Path went out that night. The cold snap ended after three nights. The Council continued to distribute salt-bloom throughout the rest of the autumn.
