; --- E2-06: On day 21 of Year 1, the moon was full. The Council convened at the Watch. The Council redistributed mire-essence across the lantern-stations. The Northcove stations contributed mire-essence to the central pool. The Council issued mire-essence from the central pool to the stations of the Middle Row. The Council recorded the redistribution in the Watch ledgers.
