; --- E3-02: On day 33 of Year 1, a harvest party of twelve people left Aelmere at sundown. Sailsworn led the harvest party along the goat-path to the Salt-bloom Tide-pools. The harvest party carried copper buckets and wooden scrapers. Coraline Ash walked with the harvest party. Sailsworn assigned each member of the harvest party to one of the five blooming pools in the Salt-bloom Tide-pools. Sailsworn assigned Coraline Ash to the second pool from the north.
