; --- E4-06: On day 85 of Year 1, the lanterns at the Hollows drew many nightmoths. The lanterns of the Cliff Path drew a handful of nightmoths that autumn. A handful of sky-cats hunted on the Cliff Path that autumn, so a handful of nightmoths fled to the Hollows. Pell wrote a note about the Hollows for the Council. The thread harvest at the Hollows rose in that week. The thread harvest on the Cliff Path stayed thin in that week.
(sem-graph E4-06)
(sem-graph-kind E4-06 neo-davidsonian)
(doc-graph aelmere E4-06)
