; --- E5-03: On day 96 of Year 1, Brindle Coombe said at the Council that the village was behind on mire-essence. Brindle Coombe said at the Council that the village was behind on feathers. Brindle Coombe said at the Council that a hard winter would force the village to dim some lanterns. Old Vesh said at the Council that the village always keeps the Stilllight Lantern lit.
