; --- E7-05: On day 258 of Year 1, a crowd of nightmoths gathered at the Harbor Row. Three sky-cats descended from the cliff-spires. The three sky-cats hunted the nightmoth crowd at the Harbor Row. The nightmoth crowd at the Harbor Row shrank. Coraline Ash counted twenty-four nightmoths at the lantern of the Harbor Station before the hunt. Coraline Ash counted nine nightmoths at the lantern of the Harbor Station after the hunt. Coraline Ash wrote notes about the hunt.
