; --- E7-07: On day 270 of Year 1, the village held the summer feast at midsummer. The keepers of Aelmere ate together at the village square at midday. The Council toasted the investiture of Coraline Ash. The Council toasted the investiture of Mira. Mira had completed her apprenticeship at the summer solstice.
