; --- E8-01: On day 365 of Year 2, the second autumn equinox came. Year 2 began on day 365. The feather store held eight weeks of supply. About ten sky-cats were visible on the cliff-spires in the morning. The salt-bloom store held eleven weeks of winter supply. The mire-essence store had not yet recovered from the losses of Year 1.
