; --- E8-03: On day 365 of Year 2, the moon was full. The Council convened at the Watch. The Council accepted Old Vesh's bright-station proposal. The Council issued extra mire-essence rations to three stations of the Middle Row in order to draw crowds of nightmoths. The Council issued the extra rations in order to keep sky-cats hunting on the Cliff Path.
