; --- E8-05: On day 396 of Year 2, Coraline Ash wrote in her log that a bright lantern draws a crowd of nightmoths. Coraline Ash wrote in her log that a crowd of nightmoths brings sky-cats down from the cliff-spires. Coraline Ash wrote in her log that sky-cats molt during hunts. Coraline Ash wrote in her log that ground feathers make the Sunken Cove safe. Coraline Ash read the note to Pell at breakfast.
