; --- E9-03: On day 440 of Year 2, Tessa Brae found a large sky-cat feather near the third cliff-spire. The feather was unusually long. Tessa Brae added the feather to the feather store. Tessa Brae reported to the Council that the feather might belong to a new sky-cat. The Council took no action.
