; --- E9-04: On day 455 of Year 2, an apprentice named Eli arrived. Eli came from a Keeper family. The Council assigned Eli to Norren. Norren was a Council member. Norren had not taken an apprentice before. Eli carried Norren's leather case from her second night. Eli did not tend a lantern alone during her first six months. Norren supervised Eli on every night of her first six months.
