; --- E10-03: On day 575 of Year 2, the cliff-spires were clearly visible from Aelmere in the morning. Keepers walked to the base of the cliff. The keepers counted the sky-cats on each cliff-spire. The keepers counted fourteen sky-cats. The census of Year 1 had estimated twelve sky-cats. The Council logged the census as an estimate.
