; --- E10-04: On day 590 of Year 2, Coraline Ash told Eli that mire-essence with salt-bloom burns slowly. Coraline Ash told Eli that the cliff-spires shield the Northcove against the north wind. Coraline Ash told Eli that the lanterns of the Northcove burn plain mire-essence. Coraline Ash told Eli that a lantern burning at full rate produces strong mist-light. Eli wrote the answers in her notebook.
