; --- E10-05: On day 605 of Year 2, a spring storm struck the harbor in the early evening. Three fishing boats were at sea. The three boats followed the lanterns of the Harbor Row. The keepers of the Harbor Row refilled the mire-essence early. The keepers of the Harbor Row shielded the lanterns against the wind. The lanterns of the Harbor Row burned through the storm. All three boats reached the harbor safely. Joren Salt was on one of the three boats. Joren Salt reached Meren Tallowhand's station before dawn.
(sem-graph E10-05)
(sem-graph-kind E10-05 neo-davidsonian)
(doc-graph aelmere E10-05)
