; --- E10-07: On day 640 of Year 2, the moon was full. Old Vesh said at the Council that the village had passed through a complete cycle. Meren Tallowhand said at the Council that the lessons of Year 1 had become the policies of Year 2. The Council closed the meeting with the phrase. Coraline Ash attended the Council as a Keeper for the first time. Coraline Ash repeated the phrase.
