; --- E10-11: The record ends on day 720 of Year 2. The mire-essence reserve held ten months of supply on day 720. The salt-bloom store held eight weeks of supply on day 720. The feather store held nine weeks of supply on day 720. The sky-cat census estimated fourteen sky-cats on day 720. Forty-four Keepers were active on day 720. Aelis Brae returned to active station-tending in the late spring of Year 2.
